                                    <h2>How to Evaluate a D2C Agency in Pune</h2>
                                    <p>1. <strong>Maharashtra + Mumbai + national fluency</strong> — Marathi + Hindi + English.<br>2. <strong>Category depth</strong> — 3+ brands in your vertical.<br>3. <strong>Multi-channel fluency</strong>.<br>4. <strong>Tech + growth integration</strong>.<br>5. <strong>Named senior owners</strong>.<br>6. <strong>Maharashtra-first + national expansion capability</strong>.<br>7. <strong>Honest disagreement</strong>.</p>
